 "insight": [
  "The largest import goods by value in Luxembourg in 2025 came mainly from Belgium, Germany, and Japan.",
  "Total imports reached 11.70 billion euros, with the top three partners accounting for 62.7% of imports.",
  "Belgium was the largest partner with imports worth 3.65 billion euros, followed by Germany at 2.58 billion euros and Japan at 1.11 billion euros.",
  "Imports from China and the Netherlands were also significant, at 702.1 million euros and 608.6 million euros respectively.",
  "The data includes 7.8% confidential imports and 7.7% from undisclosed partners, which are included in totals but not ranked by country."
 ],
